<title>FINLAND: Finnish raw wood prices rise in April -METLA.</title>
<headline>Finnish raw wood prices rise in April -METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage prices were mostly higher in April (weeks 14-18) compared to March (weeks 10-13), the Finnish Forest Research Institute METLA said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Only birch pulpwood stumpage prices eased slightly while prices rose in the two other pulpwood categories and in all three logwood categories.</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     April'97    March '97   Feb '97    Jan '97</p>
<p> Pine	   96.40	  96.20     96.70	97.00</p>
<p> Spruce	128.80	 127.40    126.70     126.20</p>
<p> Birch	  94.40	  94.50     94.30	94.50</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     April'97     March '97   Feb '97    Jan '97</p>
<p> Pine	  264.60	  255.10    252.20     251.40</p>
<p> Spruce	215.70	  210.40    208.80     207.30</p>
<p> Birch	 261.50	  252.20    250.20     246.60</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
